    <data name="FaqTitle" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Before you travel</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq1Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>How do I get to Amrum?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq1Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Take the ferry from Dagebüll to Wittdün, about 90 minutes. Our car meets every ferry and brings you to Norddorf in 15 minutes, so you can leave your car in Dagebüll.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq2Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>When can I check in and out?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq2Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Rooms are ready from 15:00 and check-out is at 11:00. Book direct and you can stay until 13:00. With mobile check-in, the app tells you the moment your room is ready.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq3Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Can I bring my dog?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq3Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Yes, in the Dune Rooms and the Lantern Lofts, for €15 a night. Dogs are welcome on the dune paths and on the beach north of the lighthouse, on a lead.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq4Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Is breakfast included?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq4Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Always, when you book direct. Booked anywhere else, it costs €24 per person. It's served in the Salt Kitchen from 7:30 to 10:30.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq5Question" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>How does the best-rate promise work?</value>
    </data>
    <data name="Faq5Answer" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>If you find the same room for the same dates cheaper within 24 hours of booking with us, send us the link. We match the price and take another 10% off.</value>
    </data>
